{c: Verse 1}
He [E]Deva Tujhya [Am]Dari Aalo,        [E]Gungaan Gaya
[E]Tujhain maan [Am]sacha,        [E]Janma jaayi vaya
He [E]deva dili [A]haak,        [Am]Udhar ka [F]raya
ba [E]dhalachi [A]chhya tujhi,        [Am]sameendarachi [F]maya
[E]Morya Morya [E]Morya Morya,        [E]Morya Morya [E]Morya Morya
